      en: ["The total surface area of the lake is 536 square kilometers.", "Lake Constance borders Germany, Austria, and Switzerland.", "The deepest point of the lake is 251 meters in the Obersee.", "About 4.5 million people get their drinking water from the lake.", "The island of Reichenau has been a UNESCO World Heritage site since 2000.", "The lake basin was shaped by the Rhine Glacier during the Würm glaciation."],
